OL,3,GNEWSAHospital entrance to undergo
OL,4,Arevamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe main entrance at a North Yorkshire
OL,7,Fhospital is to undergo a major
OL,8,Fredesign, in an effort to make it more
OL,9,Fmodern and accessible.
OL,11,FWorks will include an upgrade of the
OL,12,Fself check-in and reception facilities
OL,13,Fat Harrogate District Hospital, as well
OL,14,Fas creating new informal seating areas
OL,15,Fand more toilets, which will include a
OL,16,Fchanging places toilet.
OL,18,FThe project will also see Costa Coffee
OL,19,Fand an M&S Food store move onto the
OL,20,Fsite, replacing the hospital's Cafe
OL,21,FBistro and WH Smith.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
